# ---------------------------------------------------------------- image data
# The manuscript states that this study redistributes no image from the Kaggle
# source, which carries no licence grant -- only derived per-image statistics,
# split assignments and filenames. That statement is enforced here rather than
# merely asserted, so everything below is excluded: the archives themselves,
# and every artefact that reproduces image content rather than describing it.
#
# All of it is regenerable by the committed scripts from your own copy of the
# archives; see README.md and Appendix C of the manuscript.
data/raw/
data/raw_zips/
data/processed/
data/metadata/modality_review_sheets/
data/metadata/synthetic_counterfeit_preview/
data/metadata/split_c/
data/metadata/split_d/

# Grad-CAM overlays are rendered on top of the source photographs, so they
# carry image content. Regenerate with modeling/gradcam*.py.
modeling/results/gradcam/
modeling/results/gradcam_split_c/
modeling/results/gradcam_split_c_model3/
paper/figures/fig14_gradcam.*
paper/latex/figures/fig14_gradcam.*

# ------------------------------------------------------- built manuscript
# Regenerate with paper/scripts/build_docx.py, build_tex.py, build_poster.py.
# Excluded because they embed the figures above and because binary rebuilds
# make for unreadable diffs.
paper/PharmaChecked_v2_manuscript.docx
paper/PharmaChecked_v2_poster.pptx
paper/PharmaChecked_v2_poster.pdf
paper/_pre_ieee_backup_*/
~$*

# ------------------------------------------------------------------ python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.venv/
venv/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------ system
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

# ------------------------------------------------- superseded v1 artefacts
# The earlier manuscript was never published and is not mentioned in this
# study. Neither it nor the internal rewrite plan belongs in a public repo.
PharmaChecked_pdf_ver2*.pdf
PharmaChecked v2 Rewrite Plan.docx

# Superseded working drafts; the prose of record is paper/paper.md section II.
paper/related_work.md
paper/section_related_work.md

# ------------------------------------------- IEEE Access template (3rd party)
# The official template package and its Formata fonts are IEEE's, licensed
# for preparing submissions and NOT redistributable. Download them from the
# IEEE Author Center; they are not part of this repository.
paper/latex/ACCESS_latex_template_*/
paper/latex/*.cls
paper/latex/*.sty
paper/latex/*.bst
paper/latex/*.fd
paper/latex/*.map
paper/latex/*.pfb
paper/latex/*.tfm
paper/latex/logo.png
paper/latex/notaglinelogo.png
paper/latex/bullet.png
paper/latex/paper.pdf
paper/latex/paper.aux
paper/latex/paper.log
paper/latex/paper.out
paper/latex/*.synctex*
paper/overleaf_upload.zip

paper/latex/supplementary.pdf
paper/latex/supplementary.aux
paper/latex/supplementary.log
paper/latex/supplementary.out
paper/PharmaChecked_v2_supplementary_IEEEAccess.pdf
paper/_pre_split_backup/
